    </table>
  </section>

  <!-- 8. Representative query results -->
  <section>
    <h2>🔍 Representative Query-Level Results</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9em;margin-bottom:20px">
      Showing first 8 queries. Each block traces: Query → Expected → Fetched → TP/FP/FN.
    </p>
    
    <div class="query-detail">
      <div class="qd-header">
        <span class="qd-id">Q01</span>
        <span class="qd-cat">exact-factual-recall</span>
        <span class="qd-f1 warning">F1: 40.00%</span>
      </div>
      <div class="qd-query"><strong>Query:</strong> What is my name and where do I live?</div>

      <div class="qd-section expected">
        <div class="section-label">📋 EXPECTED (2)</div>
        <div class="memory-pill expected-pill">
            <code>eval-f001</code>
            <span class="reason">→ Directly states user's name (Arjun Mehta) and age.</span>
          </div><div class="memory-pill expected-pill">
            <code>eval-f002</code>
            <span class="reason">→ Directly states user's location (Koramangala, Bengaluru).</span>
          </div>
      </div>

      <div class="qd-section fetched">
        <div class="section-label">🔍 FETCHED (8)</div>
        <div class="memory-pill fp-pill">
            <code>eval-e008</code> ✗ FP
            <span class="mem-summary">1:1 with manager Anjali; on track for staff engineer promotion.</span>
          </div><div class="memory-pill tp-pill">
            <code>eval-f001</code> ✓ TP
